# Parcel Canopy (CIPlay parcel_canopy_solo; in the plan after Pillarbox Pier): quest "The Last Mail Flight"
# (it needs Eskil's dead letter from The Dead Letter Office: parcel_canopy_solo.play reads it first)
island Parcel Canopy
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Last Mail Flight
expect hidden tailzone
expect hidden graveflowers
expect hidden landinglight
zone beach
expect step 1
read Pilot Eskil's notebook
expect step 2
open Pilot's camp chest
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Machete 1
expect step 4
use tailvines1
expect shown tailzone
zone tail
expect step 5
use bag1
use bag2
use bag3
use bag4
use bag5
expect story mailbag 5
expect step 6
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
expect step 7
open Cargo hold
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Fueltank 1
expect item Blueprint_Pipe_Fuel 1
expect step 10
use planeradio
expect message Pneumatic Heights
expect step 11
open Fuel shed
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_BiofuelExtractor 1
expect step 13
use grave
expect story eskildelivered 1
expect shown graveflowers
expect step 14
use beacon
expect shown landinglight
expect done
